  "status": "experimental",
  "trust": "local",
  "description": "Dreadbox Murmux Adept synthesizer: every controller of its manual's CC list, with the values it shows.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "Murmux Adept User Manual",
      "notes": "CC list (page 28 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/dreadbox/import-dreadbox.mjs from Murmux_Adept_User_Manual.pdf (sha256 67f2e80614e70c9ae247d4826cfeb0aadd254e96da81ab668748e14b5540b796), https://dreadbox-fx.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Murmux_Adept_User_Manual.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/dreadbox/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/dreadbox/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the CC list, with its printed name, sent as a control change on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The list prints each value as the instrument shows it (`[0 - 99]`, `[-99 - 99]`, `[SINE, TRI, SAW, RMP, SQR, RND]`) and does not say how the controller's 0 - 127 map to it. It is taken as the Artemis's list says its own are: spread over 0 - 127, a setting sent at the middle of its share. Try one on the instrument before relying on it.",
    "Left out, the wheel, the pedals, bank select and the channel mode messages: CC 1 ModWheel, CC 64 Sustain Pedal, CC 120 All Sound off, CC 123 All Noise off."
  ],
  "variables": {
    "channel": 1
  },
